WEBVTT

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.780
Tsukuyomi Shrine Logbook.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.780
Kept by: Micchan.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.700
The head of the clan, Tsukuyomi Ruza-sama,

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.750
has stopped leaving the house
since the incident the other day.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.620
Occasionally, he switches TV channels,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.540
munches some potato chips,

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.880
and says, "God, I don't wanna work."

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.130
As you can tell, he's just lazing around all day.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:32.760
Statistics reveal his most frequently uttered phrases were:

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.010
"I don't want to work,"

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.390
"I can't be bothered,"

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.390
and "I want to die."

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.430
These three.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.560
As for specifics, he said "I don't want to work" 132 times,

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.020
"I can't be bothered" 1032 times,

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.530
and "I want to die" an immeasurable number of times.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:46.690
Ah...

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.940
I want to die.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.540
I'm not just being a shut-in.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.050
I'm defending this place.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:32.420
I can't let a single person enter this room.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:34.300
That's reckless, Sasami-sama!

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.590
The Yagami sisters are powerful gods!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.470
It's highly likely they'll break through the barrier!

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.220
Calm down, rookie.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:42.930
This time I'm taking it seriously.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.100
I'll use the power I've been stopping myself from using, the power of the supreme god,

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.690
and prevent them from invading!

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:49.190
Oh, at last!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:52.280
I'm going to do absolutely nothing during this spring break.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.650
I'll going to laze around in bed the whole time.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.530
And no one can stop me.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.660
Sasami! Sasami!

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.830
Even if it kills me, I'll stay lazy.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.040
Wow, he looks dead.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.130
Are you all right, Paparin?

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:14.300
I haven't talked with Sasami-san in 34 hours.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:18.300
I haven't touched Sasami-san in 76 hours.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.640
I haven't been in the bathroom with Sasami-san in 127 hours!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.440
Sensei, please pull yourself together.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.850
Is that you, Sasami-san?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.690
Sasami-san, Sasami-san!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.570
I missed you, Sasami-san!

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:35.150
Oh, Sasami-san, you smell so nice!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.700
Your body feels so warm!

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.360
It feels so great to hold you!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.870
I love you, Sasami-san!

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.780
I'm in love!

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.120
S-Sensei, you dummy!

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.590
At this point in time, two problems remain.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:57.760
The first is that my big sister fell into the underworld and has yet to return.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.140
The second is that

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:02.010
Sasami-san has secluded herself for an unknown reason.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.260
Please take a look.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.820
That's your and Sasami-san's house.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:15.940
This black structure is the Heavenly Rock Cave.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.990
The supreme god Amaterasu's desire not to see anyone,

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:23.490
not to meet anyone, and not to get involved with anyone materialized in that form.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:27.080
It's the ultimate barrier that appears when she wants to cut off all interaction with the outside world

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.830
and shut herself in.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.080
Wow! That's a serious problem!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.880
You grasped the situation unusually quickly, Tama.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.630
Y-Yeah.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.800
As usual, you didn't understand.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.970
Y-Yeah!

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.970
As things are now,

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:44.560
because the supreme god has abandoned her duty keeping the world under control,

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:47.020
there's a risk that a series
of inappropriate Transformations

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.810
could occur and throw the world into chaos.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.060
So that's the reason for this unusual heavy snow, huh?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.570
We intend to somehow penetrate into the Heavenly Rock Cave

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.070
and check up on Sasami-san.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:58.780
Everyone.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.570
Please hold on to me.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.620
Then, let us go.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.080
One, two!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.470
I think this is going to be dangerous!

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:39.940
Warning!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:40.900
Sasami-san!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.240
I'll start attacking if you come any closer!

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:44.950
Leave me alone!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.950
I don't want to be separated from you for even a second!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.120
I need to inhale the air you exhale.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.170
I need your sweat, your tears—
that is, your bodily secretions,

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.840
your Sasami Juice—or I'll die!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:56.960
Shut up, pervert.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:01.840
Sasami-san, you must stop shutting yourself away and disperse the Heavenly Rock Cave!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.340
Just leave me alone!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.890
It's not like I'm shutting myself in because I like doing it!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.430
Could it be that

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:13.940
you're weighed down by a big problem that makes you want to reject everything?

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.480
You should open up to me!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.690
If something's making you worry, talk to me.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:19.900
I'll help you.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.900
Well, this time, your "help" is just sticking your nose in my business!

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.070
Anyway, turn back!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.740
If you don't, I'll attack!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.160
Very well.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.870
I'll force my way in there

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.790
and make you regret being so arrogant.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.920
I'll give you a good spanking and make you cry and beg for forgiveness!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:39.300
And while I'm at it, I'll save you from your agony!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.760
Give up and leave now!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.600
You're just a shut-in. You've never fought a war!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.970
Your naive tactics won't work on me!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.160
Are you trying to melt my clothes?

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.500
That's just outrageous!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.690
If you don't give up and leave,

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:42.320
I'll destroy your clothes and spread videos of you naked on the internet

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:47.240
where you'll be the mysterious flying nude model, Excellent Kagami!

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.120
You're so merciless!

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.620
That's mean, Mamarin!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.450
Don't pick on Kagami-nee!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.500
Please, please...

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.830
Make me naked instead!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.250
Don't strip!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.960
I've already taken mine off!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.670
Get lost, pervert!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.800
I'll focus all the power I have into

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:10.470
setting you up as the world-class star, Excellent Kagami.

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:14.100
There'll be a film about you. You'll become a social phenomenon, and then a legend.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.770
If you don't want that, leave now!

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:17.770
You're so mean, Sasami-san!

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:19.520
I thought we were friends!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.270
Kagami, forgive me!

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.080
I'm here now!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:37.960
Tsurugi-nee!

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:47.630
It's hard to use Transformations to neutralize attacks

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.010
launched under the protection of the power of the supreme god,

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.970
but that problem doesn't apply to this sword!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.100
Divine sword, Gathering Clouds of Heaven!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.100
Nee-san, how did you get here?

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.100
I used this, my divine object, as my lifeline

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.020
to bring myself back from the netherworld!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.320
Gods wouldn't ordinarily be able to penetrate the Heavenly Rock Cave,

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.570
but a next generation god can eat away at it.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.280
Tama, make a hole in the Heavenly Rock Cave!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.160
Got it, Tsurugi-nee!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.080
Kagami, let's move in on the Heavenly Rock Cave!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.290
Roger that.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.170
Mow 'em down, Gathering Clouds of Heaven!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.890
Time for a treat!

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.230
They broke in?!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:45.900
Excuse the intrusion.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:51.110
Now then, explain to us what's going on, Sasami-san.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.580
Depending on what it is, I might punish you.

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.200
Don't pressure her too much.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.200
Sasami had a reason.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:00.120
Come on.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.620
Show us!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.010
Um, you see...

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.760
I didn't know what to do!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.930
I remember the pizza I had yesterday being delicious,

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.350
then I was like this when I woke up in the morning!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.100
Transformations couldn't fix it.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.150
I was afraid that you guys might start hating me

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:28.150
and that Onii-chan might abandon me.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:31.280
So I couldn't talk to any of you. I wanted some time to think about what to do.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:34.740
But you guys couldn't take a hint and had to come see me!

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:36.740
Jerks!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.200
Get out!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.500
Get out of here!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.460
I-I know how you feel, but we're friends.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.710
I wish you had just talked to me.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.550
Kagami...

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:56.090
No matter how much you eat,
you can't possibly get that fat overnight.

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:59.100
It may be an unworldly aberration or a disease.

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.020
I'll explain what's happening.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.600
The reason is that Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.980
There's one thing that's still left to do,

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.570
and you'll be coming along, Sasami.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.790
Wh-What's this? Aren't they...

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:25.670
people from the Tsukuyomi Shrine?

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.250
What's wrong, Tsukuyomi Juju?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.670
You're said to be the mightiest in history,

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.630
so show me your power.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:39.430
Don't think I'm a merely a useless vessel for the power of the supreme god!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:44.560
This is...

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:47.060
me?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.030
What? What's going on?!

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:53.820
Where are Tsurugi and others?

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.910
So... I'm my mom?

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.160
Am I in the past?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.170
Tsukuyomi Juju!

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:13.130
I, the slothful gravekeeper Baron Samedi, shall make this <i>your</i> grave!

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.880
Get her, my zombies!

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.140
Animated corpses are still dead.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.680
The dead belong...

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.850
That's the Spell of Rightful Belonging!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.770
The God of Rightful Belonging

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.110
refers to the giant rock that was placed to seal Izanami

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:37.360
when she tried to return from the netherworld!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:39.700
Thus, the spell is immediately effective against the dead.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:46.540
Foreign deity, repent, and begone from this nation!

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.840
Such a troublesome foe.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.590
Wow!

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:03.300
But why did Tsurugi take me to the past?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.470
She said we had something to do, but what?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.850
Juju-sama!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:10.440
Where are you?

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:12.400
Is that Micchan?

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.270
Oh, Juju-sama!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:15.940
Juju-sama!

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.660
Micchan!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:30.120
That was scary! I thought I was gonna die.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.750
Most people would've.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.130
I'm terribly sorry, Juju-sama.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:37.760
Ghouls are still divine beings, just those who've fallen low.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.840
You must be extremely careful when dealing with one.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.180
Yes, ma'am. I regret my carelessness.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.940
The Tsukuyomi Shrine is still standing.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.020
Then I really must be...

00:13:57.610 --> 00:13:59.490
back in the past.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:06.490
So, Micchan, wasn't there a reason why you came all the way to take me back?

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.870
Yes, Juju-sama.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.580
You see, Sasami-sama...

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.790
Huh? Me?

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.460
This way, Juju-sama.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:19.460
Sasami is always collapsing, so it's not that unusual.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:23.590
It seems she's been slipping out of the shrine to go downtown recently.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.970
Maybe she contacted an odd disease there.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.600
Doctors and shrine maidens have been treating her as best they can,

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.600
but it seems she's not getting better.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:46.450
If it's some type of a curse, it may be dangerous for you, as you have little spiritual power.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.620
Stay away.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:48.410
Understood.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.040
Please be careful, Juju-sama.

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.550
Mom...

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.180
Did I wake you?

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:12.430
I'm so sorry, Mom!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:13.560
It is fine.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:17.770
I am a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden, but I also am your mother.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:19.940
Get some more sleep.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.700
Grow up soon, Sasami.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:32.250
That's the only thing you can do.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:37.830
By the time you're an adult, the world will have become a slightly better place.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.750
Sorry for always giving you trouble.

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:42.210
I'm too weak.

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.670
Don't apologize.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.630
Weakness is not a sin.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:51.600
It is my shortcoming for not being able to change the world so you do not suffer illnesses.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.810
I won't apologize, either.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:55.640
But...

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:58.190
I'll try my best.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.180
Mom!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:34.720
Now, will I get to see Sasami grow up, or will I die first?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.480
I wonder.

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.100
Mom...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.610
At this point, she's already...

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.280
That's...

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:46.530
Onii-chan.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.490
Stop moving around so much.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.240
You're such a strange one.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.040
I know you're harmless,

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.870
but should you ever do anything to hurt the clan,

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.500
I'll crush you myself.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:07.920
I have no pity or compassion for you.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:09.930
But...

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:13.720
I do hope you are saved someday.

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:19.230
I am content with how I am now, how my life is turning out.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.690
I see.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.230
If so, I will say no more.

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:26.230
I will go back to nursing Sasami-san, then.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:40.750
His appearance must mean Sasami has been chosen.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:42.880
What was that?!

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.880
I'm hungry.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.750
Oh, it's just mom.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:49.670
No, a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden must not be servant to her desires!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.090
All desires should be suppressed for a pure mind and body—

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:03.980
Micchan!

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:04.520
Whoa!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.230
D-Do you need something, Juju-sama?

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.440
No, don't worry.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.280
Is there anything to eat?

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:14.240
The food for the night watchmen will be ready soon.

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.160
Please wait just a little longer.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:16.740
Sure.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:25.920
Oh, I know! How about making some rice porridge as a midnight snack for Sasami-san?

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:30.920
As Sasami is ill, an easily digestible food would certainly be better.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.180
Mom...

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:34.550
All right, Micchan!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.470
Make some for her!

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:36.550
Wrong!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.770
<i>You</i> should make it for Sasami-sama!

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:42.390
I cannot cook.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.150
I'll teach you how!

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:49.280
Sasami-sama is so attached to you, so she'd love to eat something you cooked yourself!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:53.490
But I don't know much about parent-child relationships,

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.280
so I can't be too confident about that.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.530
You were spirited away, after all.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:58.950
Spirited away?

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.790
You were born with too great an amount of spiritual power.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:04.580
So much so that an evil god spotted you and snatched you away,

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:08.250
after which all your spiritual powers were sucked out,

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.130
and the memory of your parents and of your own name with them.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:17.100
That's why I can tell how Sasami-san feels. She's in the same position as me.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:18.850
The same position?

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:21.430
Everyone around me is more capable than I am,

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.690
which makes me feel insecure and pushes me to try harder.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.110
I'm sure she's under great pressure for the same reason.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:32.860
So when she needs it, it'd be good for her to have a family to support her.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:36.660
My daughter will eventually have to be thrown into this hell,

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:40.490
so I'm purifying and cleansing it, making it as peaceful as I can.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.210
That's the only thing I can give my daughter.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:52.090
No, that's just an excuse I use to not be with a girl who only wants to be with her beloved mother.

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.880
However, I'm a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:58.140
I cannot be an ordinary woman, a true mother.

00:19:58.720 --> 00:19:59.890
Mom...

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:03.470
What is the right thing for me to do?

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.020
Juju-sama...

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:08.520
Mom was always thinking about me.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:12.530
Since I was going to inherit her job as the Tsukuyomi shrine maiden,

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:15.360
she tried her best to make the world a better place.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:19.910
But I betrayed her.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.780
Juju-sama, stay back!

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.040
Micchan!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.590
Why you...!

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:38.720
That's...

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.140
me?

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.640
Release my daughter!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.890
I'm afraid I can't do that!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:48.980
Oh, I cleared everyone from the area, so no one's coming to save you.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:51.940
This shrine is protected by a strong barrier!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.270
How did you get inside?!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.360
While Baron Samedi was distracting you,

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:59.490
this girl came downtown to hang out.

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:01.160
I used that opportunity to possess her!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.580
No way. It was my fault?

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:04.910
No, wait.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.620
I don't remember anything like this.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.460
This isn't my past!

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:14.250
I hid inside this girl and managed to infiltrate this place without anyone noticing.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:19.680
No one noticed my presence in the original future either.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.760
The original future?

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:22.800
What are you talking about?!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.270
Oh, I'm not talking to you.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:29.350
You're there, aren't you, Tsukuyomi Sasami?

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:31.650
Huh? How come?

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:38.360
Me?!

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.990
I'm here to make a deal with you.

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:43.450
What's going on?

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:47.500
I'm an assassin of the evil occult society Arahabaki,

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:50.750
a divine spirit residing inside this Killing Stone golem!

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:53.750
I'm a fox of white face, golden fur, and nine tails!

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.380
The Nine-tailed Fox?!

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:59.380
In this country, I'm known as the one who plays with scales, Tamamo-no-Mae.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.880
Tamamo-no-Mae...

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:06.100
So, have you ever thought about changing the future?

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.900
Sasami-san, it's time for the ending!

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:16.980
Don't just stay in bed. Come here, please!

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:21.780
I love you no matter how fat you are!

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:23.910
Actually, I'd love to be buried in your flesh!

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:27.540
I want to you to sit on me and crush me to death!

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:30.710
Please calm down, Sensei.

00:22:30.710 --> 00:22:34.210
This episode was about
the Heavenly Rock Cave and stuff,

00:22:34.210 --> 00:22:38.000
so we should drag out Sasami-san just as they do in the myth.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:40.010
I know exactly what you mean!

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:42.630
So what do we do?

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:44.430
I'll just pretend you didn't say that.

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:50.430
So basically, you have to make it sound like something fun is going on near the bed.

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:54.400
If we do that, Sasami-san might emerge from her blanket out of curiosity.

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:58.230
Gotcha! Then, let's get together and sing merrily!

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:00.780
The viewers should sing along, too!

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:03.990
I can hear your voice.

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:13.040
The symphony echoes off into the distance.

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.630
Huh? Mamarin's not coming out.

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:19.170
Isn't she sleeping?

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:21.840
Sasami-san, you shouldn't fall asleep during the broadcast!

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:24.050
What a blooper that would be!

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:26.340
Looks like my big sister is asleep, too.

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:29.220
I wonder what they're dreaming about.

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:33.100
I hear someone talking in their sleep about a nine-tailed fox or something.

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:35.440
Fox goes wow, wow!

00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:38.480
Now I'm getting sleepy, too.

00:23:42.780 --> 00:23:45.610
It's time for Lazy Shopping.

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:48.120
Today we're showcasing this product,

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:50.870
Sloppy Vacuum EX.

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:52.870
You may ask, what's so sloppy about it?

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:55.460
When the power cord is being retracted after use,

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:57.960
it doesn't go all the way and just kind of stops,

00:23:57.960 --> 00:24:00.250
so the cord dangles and gets in the way.

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:03.010
We recommend it when you want to get a little pissed off.

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:06.840
Next time, episode nine: "It's Not That I Can't Do It."
